# F0.10 — build context for the Docker images (apps/api/Dockerfile, apps/web/Dockerfile).
# Exclude local artifacts: everything the image needs is built inside the multi-stage
# build — stale host state must not leak into it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
packages/db/src/generated
.git
# Unlike gitignore, bare dockerignore patterns are anchored to the context root — without
# `**/` a nested apps/web/.env.local (real Clerk secrets) would leak into build layers.
**/.env*
